nership and atomic checkpoint authority with released BPMN0.5.0, supported human/incident commands, delivery-time broadcast cohorts, timers, bounded retry and RunBpmn/RunEtl bindings. Native composite fault policy remains unchanged.\n\nThe latest fixes prevent a terminal model from acknowledging embedding cancellation while native cancellation remains owed, and report constructor-invalid owned queued commands with contextual domain errors. Current-main integration retains actual migration lineage and restores the older public constructor alongside the new optional-lock signature.\n\n## Related issue and acceptance\n\nFixes #2898; program #2892/spec1017; retained owner-transferred Codex claim6461197535. The [qualification index](https://github.com/elsa-workflows/elsa-foundation/blob/82f6202a5/specs/1017-direct-bpmn-hosting/evidence/qualification.md) maps supported lifecycle/journey evidence and limits. #2907/#2908 and overall production acceptance remain open.\n\n## Current repair qualification\n\nCandidate e72641e67 pushed after main3e93 adoption. Both actual saved Studio families pass at b7:4 completed runs,12 stores,13 strict controls; all104 frozen inputs preserved. Hosting43/43, architecture594/594 and API15 pass at recorded sources. CSS correction4d passes frontend2812/browser241; original failures retained. Round8 running;7/16 completed,none clean. Draft; new exact-head CI,review,protected merge/post-main remain due. Broader Studio/ETL/program acceptance open. https://github.com/elsa-workflows/elsa-foundation/pull/3410#issuecomment-6545066284\n\n## Validation\n\nCandidate e72641e67 pushed after main3e93 adoption. Both actual saved Studio families pass at b7:4 completed runs,12 stores,13 strict controls; all104 frozen inputs preserved. Hosting43/43, architecture594/594 and API15 pass at recorded sources. CSS correction4d passes frontend2812/browser241; original failures retained. Round8 running;7/16 completed,none clean. Draft; new exact-head CI,review,protected merge/post-main remain due. Broader Studio/ETL/program acceptance open. https://github.com/elsa-workflows/elsa-foundation/pull/3410#issuecomment-6545066284 Earlier source-bound results/failures remain in the portable qualification index.\n\n## Remaining gates\n\nCandidate e72641e67 pushed after main3e93 adoption. Both actual saved Studio families pass at b7:4 completed runs,12 stores,13 strict controls; all104 frozen inputs preserved. Hosting43/43, architecture594/594 and API15 pass at recorded sources. CSS correction4d passes frontend2812/browser241; original failures retained. Round8 running;7/16 completed,none clean. Draft; new exact-head CI,review,protected merge/post-main remain due. Broader Studio/ETL/program acceptance open. https://github.com/elsa-workflows/elsa-foundation/pull/3410#issuecomment-6545066284 T041/T043 are evidenced; T044 prepares Implemented at merge. T042 and earlier owner decisions stay settled. T045-T047 clean exact-head review, required CI, protected merge and resulting-main remain open. No merge before verified current Studio recovery, clean exact-head full review and green required checks without unresolved holds.\n","created_at":"2026-10-28T05:42:47Z","updated_at":"2026-10-31T15:01:25Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"5866f58afab4ebcb10b064668c20abef1320bf11","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elsa-workflows/elsa-foundation/pulls/3410/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elsa-workflows/elsa-foundation/pulls/3410/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elsa-workflows/elsa-foundation/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elsa-workflows/elsa-foundation/issues/3410/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elsa-workflows/elsa-foundation/statuses/e72641e6714768987f555b52ebd36dbc129959a5","head":{"label":"elsa-workflows: